---
import NarrativeLayout from '../layouts/NarrativeLayout.astro';
import App from '../components/App';
---

<NarrativeLayout title="Channel Profitability Analysis — Cinderhaven">
  <h1>Channel Profitability Analysis</h1>
  <p class="orientation">
    The biggest-revenue channels are not the most profitable. Across ten
    channels, contribution margin ranges from 44% to 54% of revenue, and
    distribution — the route usually assumed to be cheaper — lands at the
    bottom. This tool traces where each dollar of the brand's ~$25.3M in
    combined invoiced revenue (CY2025) becomes contribution, and where it
    disappears. Cinderhaven is a fictional specialty food brand; the figures
    are illustrative.
  </p>
  <App client:load />
</NarrativeLayout>
